SUMMARY:Fairview Christmas Festival\, Parade and Tinsel Tree Trail
LOCATION:Randall Shedd Community Park\, 649 Wesley Ave. N\, Fairview
DESCRIPTION:Fairview celebrates Christmas at its town park with an evening 
 festival and caroling starting at 5 PM\, followed by a parade with floats\
 , the marching band and Santa Claus. Stroll the Tinsel Tree Trail of trees
  decorated by local families and businesses\, with sponsorships helping th
 e Fairview High robotics team\, Key Club and park upgrades. Time: 5:00 PM 
 festival and caroling\, parade follows Host: Town of Fairview and Fairview
  High School Cost: Free to attend
